  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 306.02 Obligations of Fuel Gas Trainees",
  "priorExpiration": "2015-07-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 306.02 Obligations of Fuel Gas Trainees. Licensed fuel gas fitters shall sponsor as trainees only those individuals who:\n\n(a) Work under a licensed NH fuel gas fitter who shall sponsor the trainee and oversee his/her educational and work experience meeting the requirements for fuel gas fitting licensing; and\n\n(b) Hold a currently valid trainee registration license issued by the board.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15",
